Implemented behavior:
- Poll request emitted every 5000 ms
- Luminance response consumed over CAN
- Two-state hysteresis decision: DAY above 1500 lux, NIGHT below 800 lux
- Query response over CAN with client ID, state, and state age
- Registration and unregistration over CAN
- One notification per registered client on each state change

