Implemented. A dedicated diagnostic/fault-code CAN message is now emitted alongside FAULT state behavior.

What was added:
- New diagnostic CAN message ID in protocol:
  - src/can_protocol.hpp
  - Added `FaultCode` with `LuminanceResponseTimeout`
  - Added CAN ID `0x540` as `kDiagnosticFault`

- Controller diagnostic emission logic:
  - src/day_night_controller.hpp
  - src/day_night_controller.cpp
  - Added `sendDiagnosticFault(...)`
  - Emits diagnostic active message when entering FAULT on timeout
  - Emits diagnostic clear message when recovering from FAULT on valid luminance

Diagnostic payload contract (CAN ID `0x540`):
- Byte 0: fault code
- Byte 1: active flag (`1` active, `0` cleared)
- Byte 2: previous state
- Byte 3: current state
- Bytes 4-7: timestamp ms

