Updated both skills in both locations (project-local skills and workspace-canonical skills):

### Changes Made

**software-qualification-tester** — addresses the root cause (missing test IDs in report):
- **Working Rules** — added: never subsume multiple IDs under a combined label without listing each one individually; an absent ID means the test was not executed
- **Procedure** — added step 7: cross-check the spec's test case table against the executed scenarios list before writing the report; flag any unlisted ID as a coverage gap
- **Done Criteria** — added: every QT-ID from the spec must appear individually in the report's Executed Scenarios section

