  - Execution completeness (all test cases executed, recorded individually)
  - Coverage completeness (measurement executed and result recorded)
  - Artifact completeness (full report with spec, execution, traceability, design trace, coverage, defects, sign-off)
  - Regression evidence (regression set maintained and re-executed)
- ✅ Expanded Done Criteria to explicitly require:
  - All test cases listed individually with pass/fail status
  - All requirement links verified correct by code inspection
  - Coverage measurement executed with actual % recorded (if defined)
