  - Test report with execution date, baseline hash, environment config, role sign-off

**project-manager SKILL** (affects MAN.3, MAN.6, SUP.1, SUP.9):
- ✅ Added PA 1.1 Completeness Checklist for:
  - **MAN.3 completeness:** Scope, deliverables, milestones, work packages, roles, resources, dependencies, assumptions, quality gates, reviews, effort and schedule estimates all defined and justified
  - **MAN.6 completeness:** All metrics collected, quantified, with baseline hash and date. Progress, requirement coverage, defect tracking, build health, test completion, risk exposure, code coverage tracked
  - **SUP.1 completeness:** All planned QA activities executed with documented audit records (activity date, scope, items checked, findings, disposition). Full lifecycle coverage.
  - **SUP.9 completeness:** All problems tracked with ID, status, detected date, resolution date, priority, impact. Status values non-contradictory.
- ✅ Added explicit QA audit execution as Procedure Step 10:
