  - **MAN.6:** All metrics collected with quantified values, baseline refs, and dates. Quality variances documented with explanation.
  - **SUP.1:** All planned QA activities executed and documented in audit log with findings disposition. Full lifecycle coverage evidence.
  - **SUP.9:** All problems logged with consistent non-contradictory status values
  - Management artifact date reconciliation across all documents
  - Effort/quality variance explanation (no silent gaps)
  - No placeholder text in formal records
  - All work products carry revision/date/author/status headers
